# Sonic Mania MiSTer wrapper: menu.cpp patch
#
# This is intentionally a no-op patch for Phase 4. The upstream `Main_MiSTer`
# `menu.cpp` is used unchanged. The wrapper entry happens through our renamed
# `sonicmania_main.cpp`, which replaces upstream `main.cpp` (excluded by
# Makefile.full.sonic-mania via `$(filter-out main.cpp, ...)`). That's the
# only wiring needed: `main()` calls `sonicmania_wrapper_run()`.
#
# The 3sx-mister `main-mister-full-menu.patch` injected direct-P2P netplay OSD
# submenu items into `menu.cpp`. Sonic Mania defers wrapper-driven netplay
# OSD to Phase 7 (per docs/phase-4-plan.md §6.5 -- "Input SHM (deferred)").
# When that future phase re-enables SHM / wrapper OSD, a fresh patch will be
# added here.
#
# `git apply --whitespace=nowarn` accepts this file as a zero-hunk patch and
# completes successfully, so `tools/mister-wrapper/build-hps.sh` does not need
# to special-case an absent patch.
